# Baton — queue packet · feeds a full pipe one message at a time
# Invariant: each packet arrives whole on its own · order carried by index, never by memory
# Born the night the conversation pipe itself said it was full
kind baton
name queue_packet
carrier counsel
crosses full_pipe_to_fresh_seat
status reconstructed
# packet index and total — n of m
field index
# the payload — titles · urls · targets · mappings, whole in one message
field payload
# what the receiving seat does with this packet alone
field motion
